---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Domain"
  description="Masa aktif domain zonapas.web.id dan cara memperpanjangnya lewat registrar RDP Murah."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-6">
    <div class="border-b-2 border-[#0A2540] pb-4 dark:border-white">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Domain</h1>
      <div class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-20 rounded bg-[#FACC15]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Masa aktif domain zonapas.web.id dan cara memperpanjangnya. Halaman ini hanya untuk Administrator.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Status -->
    <div id="status" class="mt-4 hidden rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium" role="status"></div>

    <!-- Login -->
    <section id="login-box" class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 text-center dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <img src="/images/logo-zonapas.png" alt="Logo ZonaPas" class="mx-auto h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover" width="64" height="64" />
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold">Masuk untuk membuka halaman Domain</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-1 max-w-md text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Masuk dengan GitHub (khusus Administrator) atau dengan akun Google Redaksi Anda.
      </p>
      <button
        id="btn-login"
        type="button"
        class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0A2540] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#123a66]"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.03 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z" /></svg>
        Masuk dengan GitHub
      </button>
      <a
        href="/redaksi/auth/google"
        class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#0A2540] hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800"
      >
        Masuk dengan Google
      </a>
      <p id="login-fallback" class="mt-3 hidden text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Popup diblokir?
        <a href="https://oauth.zonapas.web.id/auth" target="_blank" class="font-bold text-[#0A2540] underline dark:text-white">Buka login GitHub di tab baru</a>
        — setelah otorisasi, kembali ke tab ini.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Akses ditolak (akun tanpa binding peran) -->
    <section id="akses-ditolak" class="mt-6 hidden rounded-2xl border border-red-300 bg-red-50 p-6 text-center dark:border-red-900 dark:bg-red-900/20">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-100">Akun ini belum punya akses</h2>
      <p id="akses-ditolak-pesan" class="mx-auto mt-1 max-w-md text-sm text-red-800 dark:text-red-200">Akun ini belum punya akses — hubungi Administrator untuk meminta akses Portal Redaksi.</p>
      <button id="btn-akses-keluar" type="button" class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Keluar &amp; Coba Akun Lain</button>
    </section>

    <!-- Isi (setelah login) -->
    <div id="app" class="hidden">
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span id="user-chip" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold dark:bg-slate-800">
          <img id="user-avatar" alt="" class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full" width="24" height="24" />
          <span id="user-name"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex-1"></span>
        <a href="/portal/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">← Kembali ke Portal</a>
        <button id="btn-keluar" type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Keluar</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Kartu status domain -->
      <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black">zonapas.web.id</h2>
          <span data-domain-status class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-900/50 dark:text-emerald-200">Aktif</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white"><span data-domain-sisa>…</span> <span class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">hari lagi</span></p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Berlaku sampai <b>4 November 2027</b>. Didaftarkan 4 November 2026 (masa aktif 1 tahun).</p>
        <dl class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-3 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Registrar (tempat mendaftar)</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-bold">RDP Murah — PT Citraweb Digital Multisolusi</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-3 dark:bg-slate-800">
            <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Nameserver</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-bold">Cloudflare (aria &amp; marvin.ns.cloudflare.com)</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <a
          href="https://rdpmurah.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#FACC15] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-[#0A2540] hover:bg-[#eab308]"
        >
          Perpanjang Domain →
        </a>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Membuka situs RDP Murah di tab baru. Pembayaran dilakukan di sana dengan akun RDP Murah Anda.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Cara memperpanjang -->
      <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black">Cara memperpanjang (5 langkah)</h2>
        <ol class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0A2540] text-xs font-black text-white">1</span><span>Ketuk tombol <b>Perpanjang Domain</b> di atas — situs RDP Murah terbuka di tab baru.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0A2540] text-xs font-black text-white">2</span><span>Masuk ke akun RDP Murah yang dipakai saat mendaftar domain ini.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0A2540] text-xs font-black text-white">3</span><span>Buka menu <b>Domain</b>, pilih <b>zonapas.web.id</b>, lalu ketuk <b>Perpanjang / Renew</b>.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0A2540] text-xs font-black text-white">4</span><span>Pilih masa perpanjangan <b>1 tahun</b>, lalu bayar dengan metode yang tersedia di sana (QRIS / transfer / virtual account).</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0A2540] text-xs font-black text-white">5</span><span>Selesai — masa aktif bertambah 1 tahun dari tanggal kedaluwarsa lama (<b>4 November 2027 → 4 November 2028</b>). Perpanjang lebih awal <b>tidak menghilangkan</b> sisa masa aktif.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-900/30 dark:text-amber-100">
          <b>Yang perlu diingat:</b> biaya perpanjangan mengikuti tarif RDP Murah saat itu (ekstensi .web.id umumnya puluhan ribu rupiah per tahun) — angka pastinya terlihat di halaman perpanjang sebelum Anda membayar. Jarvis akan mengingatkan 30 hari dan 7 hari sebelum kedaluwarsa.
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-red-50 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-red-900 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-100">
          <b>Jangan sampai lewat 4 November 2027.</b> Domain yang kedaluwarsa dan tidak diperpanjang akan berhenti dibuka, lalu bisa dilepas dan didaftarkan orang lain.
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src="/kelola-umum.js?v=16"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    // Hitung mundur masa aktif domain (kedaluwarsa 4 Nov 2027, 23:59 UTC).
    (function () {
      var akhir = new Date('2027-11-04T23:59:59Z').getTime();
      var sisa = Math.max(0, Math.ceil((akhir - Date.now()) / 86400000));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-domain-sisa]').forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = String(sisa); });
      var badge = document.querySelector('[data-domain-status]');
      if (badge) {
        if (sisa === 0) {
          badge.textContent = 'Kedaluwarsa';
          badge.className = 'rounded-full bg-red-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-red-800 dark:bg-red-900/50 dark:text-red-200';
        } else if (sisa <= 30) {
          badge.textContent = 'Segera perpanjang';
          badge.className = 'rounded-full bg-red-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-red-800 dark:bg-red-900/50 dark:text-red-200';
        } else if (sisa <= 90) {
          badge.textContent = 'Segera perpanjang';
          badge.className = 'rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/50 dark:text-amber-200';
        }
      }
    })();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
